      "whyItIsNotReSealed": "It is a record of the bytes that ran, taken before they ran.  Re-sealing it now would make it pin a file that never produced anything, which is the one thing it exists to rule out.  Six of its seven pins still match the live file byte for byte.  The seventh is the gate, and its drift is declared here rather than absorbed quietly.",
